exports[`NSW building form and adviser debt recovery list (golden) > the building's edit form 1`] = `"<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><form action="javascript:throw new Error(&#x27;React form unexpectedly submitted.&#x27;)"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-5"><div class="sm:col-span-2"><label for="name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Scheme Name<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="name" type="text" required="" placeholder="e.g. Harbour View Towers OC" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="name" value="Harbour View"/></div><div class=""><label for="planNumber" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Plan Number<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="planNumber" type="text" required="" placeholder="e.g. SP 12345" readOnly="" aria-readonly="true" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-muted cursor-not-allowed" name="planNumber" value="SP 12345"/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Locked. Only StrataVerze can change the plan number, address, lots and entitlement.</p></div><div class=""><label for="abnNumber" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">ABN</label><input id="abnNumber" type="text" placeholder="e.g. 12 345 678 901" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="abnNumber" value=""/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Optional</p></div><div class="sm:col-span-2"><label for="address" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Street Address<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="address" type="text" required="" placeholder="e.g. 42 Macquarie Street" readOnly="" aria-readonly="true" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-muted cursor-not-allowed" name="address"/></div><div class=""><label for="suburb" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Suburb<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="suburb" type="text" required="" placeholder="e.g. Sydney" readOnly="" aria-readonly="true" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-muted cursor-not-allowed" name="suburb"/></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class=""><label for="state" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">State<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input type="hidden" name="state" value="NSW"/><select id="state" required="" disabled="" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-muted cursor-not-allowed"><option value="NSW" selected="">New South Wales</option></select><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Only New South Wales buildings can be set up for now.</p></div><div class=""><label for="postcode" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Postcode<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="postcode" type="text" required="" placeholder="2000" readOnly="" aria-readonly="true" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-muted cursor-not-allowed" name="postcode"/></div></div><div class=""><label for="totalLots" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Total Lots<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="totalLots" type="number" required="" placeholder="e.g. 24" readOnly="" aria-readonly="true" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-muted cursor-not-allowed" name="totalLots" value="2"/></div><div class=""><label for="totalEntitlement" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Total Unit Entitlement<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="totalEntitlement" type="number" required="" placeholder="e.g. 1000" readOnly="" aria-readonly="true" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-muted cursor-not-allowed" name="totalEntitlement" value="100"/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The aggregate unit entitlement: the lots&#x27; unit entitlements add up to it</p></div><div class=""><label for="financialYearEnd" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Financial Year End<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="financialYearEnd" type="date" required="" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="financialYearEnd" value="2027-06-30"/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The last day of the building&#x27;s current financial year (day, month and year). The day and m